WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.074
Support us and become VIP member 
to remove all ads from www.OpenSubtitles.org

2
00:00:15.098 --> 00:00:20.062
[voice] Venu al rao. Kal-El!

3
00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:28.195
[Clark groans]

4
00:00:28.987 --> 00:00:30.489
What happened?

5
00:00:31.156 --> 00:00:32.281
Where are we?

6
00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:37.037
What have you done to him?

7
00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:38.306
[Chief Steward]
We have made him

8
00:00:38.330 --> 00:00:40.040
what he was meant to be.

9
00:00:40.123 --> 00:00:43.460
Why have you returned to us
in your failure. Kal-El?

10
00:00:43.502 --> 00:00:45.671
You sent me those visions.

11
00:00:45.712 --> 00:00:48.298
You called me here
to get my powers back.

12
00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:50.050
We did not call you here.

13
00:00:50.133 --> 00:00:52.344
Power belongs to conquerors.

14
00:00:52.678 --> 00:00:56.056
All you have shown us
is weakness.

15
00:00:56.682 --> 00:00:57.683
Brainiac.

16
00:00:58.642 --> 00:01:00.185
Yes.

17
00:01:00.227 --> 00:01:03.522
But we are not the mad. twisted
creature you met on Kandor.

18
00:01:04.438 --> 00:01:07.901
We are the Brainiac
of old Krypton. uncorrupted.

19
00:01:08.318 --> 00:01:11.154
And we can
give you what you seek.

20
00:01:12.656 --> 00:01:14.199
You can restore my powers?

21
00:01:15.325 --> 00:01:17.619
We can and we desire to.

22
00:01:17.995 --> 00:01:21.456
But first. you must become
what you were meant to be.

23
00:01:21.914 --> 00:01:24.167
You must show us
you are a conqueror.

24
00:01:26.211 --> 00:01:27.254
Conqueror?

25
00:01:28.088 --> 00:01:29.715
Hurting people
doesn't make you strong.

26
00:01:30.882 --> 00:01:32.342
And losing your power.

27
00:01:32.718 --> 00:01:35.220
your noble birthright
to a mere human?

28
00:01:36.263 --> 00:01:38.890
Is that what strength
looks like. Kal-El?

29
00:01:39.640 --> 00:01:42.853
Do you want these powers
or do you not?

30
00:01:44.979 --> 00:01:46.481
What do I have to do?

31
00:01:47.107 --> 00:01:50.402
You have to learn
what strength is.

32
00:01:52.362 --> 00:01:55.407
[tribal drumming]

33
00:01:55.574 --> 00:01:56.866
What?

34
00:01:58.076 --> 00:01:59.786
What is this?

35
00:02:01.788 --> 00:02:04.041
[Chief Steward] This is
what you came for. Kal-El.

36
00:02:04.916 --> 00:02:07.628
Prove to us here
in Krypton's ancient past

37
00:02:07.836 --> 00:02:10.005
that you are worthy
of our power.

38
00:02:10.589 --> 00:02:13.884
and we will make you
strong again.

39
00:02:21.099 --> 00:02:22.225
How's Kara?

40
00:02:22.267 --> 00:02:24.436
She's alive.
but she needs real help.

41
00:02:25.103 --> 00:02:26.938
I. I don't know what to do.

42
00:02:27.230 --> 00:02:29.358
Hey. where's Dad?

43
00:02:29.816 --> 00:02:31.902
Clark? He...

44
00:02:32.194 --> 00:02:33.236
[Waller] Lane.

45
00:02:34.071 --> 00:02:37.324
I'm taking command
of these new Kryptonian assets.

46
00:02:37.406 --> 00:02:38.367
Assets?

47
00:02:38.408 --> 00:02:40.077
They're barely
more than children.

48
00:02:40.118 --> 00:02:42.496
There's a monster on the loose.

49
00:02:42.579 --> 00:02:44.456
It defeated Supergirl.

50
00:02:44.539 --> 00:02:45.874
It's impervious to Kryptonite.

51
00:02:45.916 --> 00:02:47.584
And no one knows
when it's coming back.

52
00:02:47.626 --> 00:02:50.087
But when it does. I need
your little scout troop

53
00:02:50.128 --> 00:02:52.506
taking orders from Uncle Sam.

54
00:02:52.589 --> 00:02:54.591
The kids aren't soldiers.

55
00:02:54.633 --> 00:02:57.427
We're living in a post
Superman world. Lane.

56
00:02:57.844 --> 00:03:01.056
Catch up.
No one is coming to save us.

57
00:03:04.393 --> 00:03:05.560
[sighs wearily]

58
00:03:05.644 --> 00:03:07.270
Supergirl needs an infirmary.

59
00:03:07.312 --> 00:03:08.647
I'll go see about a medic.

60
00:03:08.689 --> 00:03:10.273
Get those assets in line.

61
00:03:10.315 --> 00:03:11.566
I need soldiers.

62
00:03:14.569 --> 00:03:15.612
[growls]

63
00:03:16.321 --> 00:03:17.656
[Clark] Where are we?

64
00:03:17.739 --> 00:03:19.825
[Chief Steward] Where you will
prove your strength.

65
00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:22.744
Your people were once
as you are now.

66
00:03:23.662 --> 00:03:26.707
Primitive. weak. flightless.

67
00:03:27.541 --> 00:03:28.750
But when invaders

68
00:03:28.792 --> 00:03:30.669
from the stars attacked
your ancient ancestors.

69
00:03:31.294 --> 00:03:33.255
the first Kryptonians
conquered them

70
00:03:33.505 --> 00:03:35.674
with no more power
than you have now.

71
00:03:36.466 --> 00:03:38.635
They took from their enemy

72
00:03:38.677 --> 00:03:40.387
the secrets
of strength. of flight.

73
00:03:40.470 --> 00:03:44.307
They turned
their dying star into Rao.

74
00:03:44.641 --> 00:03:46.727
the living sun
whose offspring powers

75
00:03:46.810 --> 00:03:49.521
your fortress even now.

76
00:03:49.603 --> 00:03:52.691
They became Krypton.

77
00:03:53.150 --> 00:03:54.735
Why are you telling me all this?

78
00:03:54.817 --> 00:03:57.487
Because those invaders
are coming. Kal-El.

79
00:03:57.696 --> 00:03:59.281
This very night.

80
00:03:59.406 --> 00:04:00.907
And you will face them.

81
00:04:01.575 --> 00:04:02.701
What?

82
00:04:03.076 --> 00:04:04.369
Conquer the invaders!

83
00:04:04.703 --> 00:04:07.789
Show us that you have that
ancient strength within you.

84
00:04:07.956 --> 00:04:10.542
and we will restore your power.

85
00:04:12.210 --> 00:04:14.421
But this isn't real. is it?

86
00:04:14.838 --> 00:04:17.507
[Chief Steward] Your foes
will be as real as you are.

87
00:04:17.716 --> 00:04:20.969
If you let them kill you.
you will perish.

88
00:04:21.470 --> 00:04:22.512
Wait. I...

89
00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:26.183
[softly] I don't want to
hurt anyone.

90
00:04:28.393 --> 00:04:31.772
[intense music playing]

91
00:04:32.522 --> 00:04:33.940
The invaders.

92
00:04:37.486 --> 00:04:39.988
[somber music playing]

93
00:04:44.034 --> 00:04:46.661
Okay. Clark's not here but
you can do this on your own.

94
00:04:46.745 --> 00:04:48.121
They're your kids.

95
00:04:49.748 --> 00:04:50.791
Great news!

96
00:04:50.999 --> 00:04:52.459
I've spoken with Director Waller

97
00:04:52.542 --> 00:04:54.920
and we've got a new plan
to stop Eradicator.

98
00:04:55.253 --> 00:04:57.422
save the future.
and get you two home.

99
00:04:57.672 --> 00:04:59.632
Let me guess. The plan
is for us to risk our lives

100
00:04:59.966 --> 00:05:02.969
fighting that monster again
while you watch?

101
00:05:03.220 --> 00:05:04.262
I do...

102
00:05:04.596 --> 00:05:07.015
Look. the plan is
for everyone to do their part.

103
00:05:07.224 --> 00:05:08.224
Mm-hmm. Yeah. and.

104
00:05:08.266 --> 00:05:09.976
and how does dad feel
about this plan?

105
00:05:10.435 --> 00:05:12.604
Come to think of it.
where is he?

106
00:05:12.938 --> 00:05:14.940
Your father's found a way
to recover his powers.

107
00:05:15.273 --> 00:05:16.525
He's gone to look for them.

108
00:05:16.691 --> 00:05:17.734
But he'll be back!

109
00:05:17.859 --> 00:05:19.694
We're never enough for you. huh?

110
00:05:21.112 --> 00:05:22.781
In every single timeline

111
00:05:23.031 --> 00:05:24.950
your plan is just.
"bring back Dad."

112
00:05:25.367 --> 00:05:26.487
Lara. let's get out of here.

113
00:05:26.868 --> 00:05:28.620
Maybe we should hear Mom out.

114
00:05:28.787 --> 00:05:30.789
Ugh! You always take her side.

115
00:05:30.956 --> 00:05:32.749
She's not even our real mom!

116
00:05:32.916 --> 00:05:34.417
Why listen to her?

117
00:05:34.626 --> 00:05:36.169
Maybe you should listen to her

118
00:05:36.253 --> 00:05:39.381
because your last plan
to murder Lex Luthor

119
00:05:39.422 --> 00:05:41.424
created
an uncontrollable monster

120
00:05:41.591 --> 00:05:42.968
that beat Kara unconscious

121
00:05:43.134 --> 00:05:44.970
before disappearing
into the time stream!

122
00:05:45.303 --> 00:05:46.805
Maybe that's why. Jonathan!

123
00:05:47.472 --> 00:05:48.807
Sorry for saving your life. Mom.

124
00:05:49.683 --> 00:05:51.003
I guess I can't
do anything right.

125
00:05:51.560 --> 00:05:52.769
Jonathan... Wait!

126
00:05:52.978 --> 00:05:54.218
I... I... I... I didn't mean...

127
00:05:54.980 --> 00:05:56.773
Jonathan's always like this.

128
00:05:57.524 --> 00:06:00.527
Yeah. because
I made him that way.

129
00:06:02.571 --> 00:06:05.574
Okay. let's get a look
at these invaders.

130
00:06:11.830 --> 00:06:13.456
[metal groaning]

131
00:06:16.042 --> 00:06:17.502
Oh. boy. Halt!

132
00:06:17.919 --> 00:06:19.671
My warriors have you surrounded.

133
00:06:20.046 --> 00:06:22.465
Surrender or...
Uh... Oh. no!

134
00:06:23.508 --> 00:06:25.468
[grunts]

135
00:06:26.344 --> 00:06:27.888
[speaking Coluan]
Jo p'raa horvat!

136
00:06:30.515 --> 00:06:32.017
Ah!
[grunts]

137
00:06:40.150 --> 00:06:42.402
[intense music playing]

138
00:06:46.698 --> 00:06:47.699
[Alien Leader] Ah-ha!

139
00:06:48.074 --> 00:06:49.701
[Clark grunts]

140
00:06:53.914 --> 00:06:55.665
[Clark straining]

141
00:06:59.127 --> 00:07:00.503
[intense music playing]

142
00:07:01.713 --> 00:07:03.173
[both grunting]

143
00:07:05.383 --> 00:07:06.718
[Clark panting]

144
00:07:10.555 --> 00:07:11.765
[Clark grunts]
[panting]

145
00:07:12.057 --> 00:07:13.558
-What?
-[speaking Coluan] En de Mat!

146
00:07:14.142 --> 00:07:17.729
[both scream]

147
00:07:21.024 --> 00:07:23.234
Okay. Clark's still gone.
Jon has disappeared.

148
00:07:23.360 --> 00:07:25.737
and a time traveling monster
is coming to kill us.

149
00:07:26.488 --> 00:07:28.782
Which of those problems
would you tackle first?

150
00:07:28.907 --> 00:07:31.910
Wait. aren't you
supposed to know?

151
00:07:32.034 --> 00:07:33.995
I thought I did
before I ruined everything

152
00:07:34.079 --> 00:07:35.538
and chased your brother away.

153
00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:38.582
I can't make this
kind of decision.

154
00:07:39.084 --> 00:07:40.585
I'll screw it up.

155
00:07:41.920 --> 00:07:43.922
Lara. this is your life.

156
00:07:44.506 --> 00:07:45.924
Whether we work
with Waller or not.

157
00:07:46.091 --> 00:07:47.926
you have to have a say in this.

158
00:07:48.093 --> 00:07:49.719
We can figure it out together

159
00:07:49.761 --> 00:07:51.638
but we can't do that
unless you trust yourself.

160
00:07:53.765 --> 00:07:54.766
Here.

161
00:07:54.933 --> 00:07:56.267
Trust yourself.

162
00:07:57.060 --> 00:07:58.311
Look at that.

163
00:08:00.271 --> 00:08:01.272
[Lois] What?

164
00:08:01.356 --> 00:08:02.482
How do you have...

165
00:08:02.816 --> 00:08:05.944
You gave me the same pep talk
before I left on this mission.

166
00:08:06.903 --> 00:08:08.488
And almost the same compass.

167
00:08:09.239 --> 00:08:13.368
Future Lois. your mom.
she said the same things I did?

168
00:08:13.451 --> 00:08:14.577
[Lara laughs]

169
00:08:14.619 --> 00:08:15.787
Pretty much.

170
00:08:16.329 --> 00:08:17.664
But with more stuff about

171
00:08:17.747 --> 00:08:19.290
how you and Grandpa
never got along.

172
00:08:19.457 --> 00:08:20.709
[laughs]

173
00:08:21.251 --> 00:08:23.878
Well. Dad and I
are too much alike.

174
00:08:26.214 --> 00:08:27.257
Huh.

175
00:08:27.507 --> 00:08:29.050
You know
who could use a hot dog?

176
00:08:32.261 --> 00:08:33.304
[groans]

177
00:08:33.763 --> 00:08:35.056
[shouts] No!

178
00:08:35.557 --> 00:08:37.308
[panting]

179
00:08:37.726 --> 00:08:38.768
I...

180
00:08:39.977 --> 00:08:41.104
I lost.

181
00:08:44.315 --> 00:08:45.650
Jimmy Flamebird?

182
00:08:46.192 --> 00:08:47.152
[gasps]

183
00:08:47.193 --> 00:08:48.903
Kara. you're okay!

184
00:08:49.029 --> 00:08:50.530
This is great!

185
00:08:50.739 --> 00:08:53.742
I am indeed conscious. Hah.

186
00:08:54.325 --> 00:08:55.493
What a coincidence

187
00:08:55.577 --> 00:08:57.996
that. uh. you would be here
when I woke up.

188
00:08:58.621 --> 00:09:00.248
He's been here the whole time.

189
00:09:00.707 --> 00:09:02.042
Why did you not leave the tent?

190
00:09:02.417 --> 00:09:03.668
Because you were here.

191
00:09:03.835 --> 00:09:05.712
And I'm not gonna
leave you alone again.

192
00:09:06.004 --> 00:09:08.006
[stomach growling]

193
00:09:08.840 --> 00:09:11.676
Oh! Thank you. Lois Lane.

194
00:09:12.552 --> 00:09:16.264
Anytime.
How recovered do you feel?

195
00:09:16.556 --> 00:09:18.683
Oh. I am ready to fight.

196
00:09:18.850 --> 00:09:19.934
Great! Great.

197
00:09:20.060 --> 00:09:21.853
Uh. how about
instead of fighting.

198
00:09:21.936 --> 00:09:23.855
you go have a word with Jon?

199
00:09:23.980 --> 00:09:26.357
Are you unable to parent him
yourself. Lois Lane?

200
00:09:26.566 --> 00:09:27.525
That's...

201
00:09:27.567 --> 00:09:29.569
That's exactly it. actually.

202
00:09:29.861 --> 00:09:31.821
Um. I can't do this all alone.

203
00:09:32.322 --> 00:09:34.407
And is Kal-El
unable to assist you?

204
00:09:34.491 --> 00:09:36.910
[intense music playing]

205
00:09:38.953 --> 00:09:40.205
[Clark groans]

206
00:09:42.457 --> 00:09:43.665
[mumbling]

207
00:09:43.708 --> 00:09:44.876
[Chief Steward] Be still.

208
00:09:54.302 --> 00:09:55.887
I gotta stop
waking up like this.

209
00:09:56.471 --> 00:09:57.514
[metal groans]

210
00:09:58.723 --> 00:10:00.183
[Alien Leader groaning]

211
00:10:01.017 --> 00:10:02.060
[grunts]

212
00:10:03.728 --> 00:10:04.771
[sighs wearily]

213
00:10:06.606 --> 00:10:07.607
[growls]

214
00:10:07.690 --> 00:10:09.317
[speaking Coluan]
En de mat. Huzar!

215
00:10:09.400 --> 00:10:10.360
Wait. wait. wait. wait!

216
00:10:10.401 --> 00:10:11.736
Ah!

217
00:10:14.739 --> 00:10:15.990
[exclaims]

218
00:10:17.242 --> 00:10:18.284
[Clark] Just listen.

219
00:10:18.368 --> 00:10:19.410
[grunts]

220
00:10:20.120 --> 00:10:23.206
[both shout]

221
00:10:23.623 --> 00:10:24.666
[grunts]

222
00:10:28.545 --> 00:10:30.713
[growls]

223
00:10:35.593 --> 00:10:37.345
What was I...

224
00:10:37.428 --> 00:10:38.346
[Alien Leader panting]

225
00:10:38.429 --> 00:10:39.430
Your arm.

226
00:10:39.806 --> 00:10:41.307
[whimpering]

227
00:10:41.724 --> 00:10:43.893
[Clark grunts] Hold still. Ugh!

228
00:10:45.061 --> 00:10:47.814
[Alien Leader panting]

229
00:10:48.273 --> 00:10:49.232
No more fighting.

230
00:10:49.274 --> 00:10:50.984
I am your friend.

231
00:10:51.609 --> 00:10:53.611
Friend.

232
00:10:53.653 --> 00:10:54.696
Fuh...

233
00:10:55.488 --> 00:10:58.241
Fuh... rend.

234
00:11:01.119 --> 00:11:02.912
[bang]

235
00:11:02.954 --> 00:11:03.997
[grunts]

236
00:11:05.373 --> 00:11:06.416
[bang]

237
00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:08.293
[grunts]

238
00:11:10.295 --> 00:11:12.005
Hello. Jonathan Lane.

239
00:11:12.088 --> 00:11:14.299
Are you playing moon catch?

240
00:11:14.799 --> 00:11:16.009
Leave me alone.

241
00:11:17.844 --> 00:11:19.804
It is better to talk
than to run.

242
00:11:19.929 --> 00:11:21.249
You will not be
able to escape me.

243
00:11:21.431 --> 00:11:22.473
What do you want?

244
00:11:23.224 --> 00:11:25.268
I want to know
why you're on the moon

245
00:11:25.768 --> 00:11:28.730
and why you are angry at me.
who saved your life?

246
00:11:30.231 --> 00:11:32.817
I'm not angry at you.
Aunt Kara. I just...

247
00:11:33.693 --> 00:11:36.070
I went off mission.
I let Lara leave by herself.

248
00:11:36.196 --> 00:11:37.488
I let Eradicator escape.

249
00:11:37.697 --> 00:11:40.700
I tried this before. I failed.
I'm failing again.

250
00:11:40.825 --> 00:11:42.265
and that's why
everyone always wishes

251
00:11:42.410 --> 00:11:45.830
I was my perfect dad.
because who wants me?

252
00:11:47.999 --> 00:11:49.834
You are mistaken.

253
00:11:51.628 --> 00:11:54.047
Your father is not perfect.

254
00:11:54.964 --> 00:11:57.342
Lois Lane and the others
imagine that he is perfect

255
00:11:57.425 --> 00:12:00.553
because even in failure.
he will not give up on them.

256
00:12:01.346 --> 00:12:03.014
And I will not give up on you.

257
00:12:03.681 --> 00:12:05.350
They need us.

258
00:12:09.854 --> 00:12:11.189
Jonathan!

259
00:12:13.566 --> 00:12:14.859
You came back.

260
00:12:17.320 --> 00:12:18.363
Jonathan has returned

261
00:12:18.446 --> 00:12:20.323
to help us
defeat the Eradicator.

262
00:12:20.365 --> 00:12:22.825
I won't take orders
from you or Amanda Waller.

263
00:12:22.951 --> 00:12:25.119
And I'll prove to you
that I can do this myself!

264
00:12:25.536 --> 00:12:28.206
Mm! I'm just glad you're back.

265
00:12:31.251 --> 00:12:33.878
Hope your little super teens
are ready for a fight.

266
00:12:33.962 --> 00:12:36.214
Lex has found
a temporal anomaly.

267
00:12:37.048 --> 00:12:38.174
Time travel.

268
00:12:39.092 --> 00:12:41.052
[intense music playing]

269
00:12:53.523 --> 00:12:55.275
Whoa. I got you. buddy.

270
00:12:55.900 --> 00:12:57.402
You need to rest.

271
00:13:03.533 --> 00:13:05.410
[suspenseful music playing]

272
00:13:07.620 --> 00:13:09.163
We'll get you back to your ship.

273
00:13:10.164 --> 00:13:12.000
I need to get home
to my people. too.

274
00:13:13.293 --> 00:13:14.419
[growling]

275
00:13:14.460 --> 00:13:15.503
Look out!

276
00:13:15.920 --> 00:13:16.921
Aah!

277
00:13:17.005 --> 00:13:18.214
[Clark] No!

278
00:13:19.716 --> 00:13:23.136
[beast growling]

279
00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:24.762
[Clark grunts]

280
00:13:27.390 --> 00:13:29.392
[panting]

281
00:13:29.767 --> 00:13:30.977
[grunts]

282
00:13:35.648 --> 00:13:36.858
[Clark straining]

283
00:13:38.443 --> 00:13:40.486
I can't die here.

284
00:13:41.279 --> 00:13:42.947
Aah!

285
00:13:45.616 --> 00:13:47.118
[intense music playing]

286
00:13:49.746 --> 00:13:51.039
[beast growls]

287
00:13:58.254 --> 00:13:59.589
Aah!

288
00:14:00.715 --> 00:14:02.633
[panting]

289
00:14:02.884 --> 00:14:04.552
What's happening to me?

290
00:14:05.970 --> 00:14:07.680
[Alien Leader gasping]

291
00:14:10.641 --> 00:14:12.352
Oh. no. No. no.

292
00:14:15.730 --> 00:14:17.565
Stay with me. buddy.

293
00:14:18.358 --> 00:14:19.984
[Clark] We can make it home.

294
00:14:21.611 --> 00:14:22.737
We have to.

295
00:14:25.323 --> 00:14:26.616
[buzzes]

296
00:14:27.241 --> 00:14:28.993
[Waller] This
is the site of Zero Day.

297
00:14:29.369 --> 00:14:31.704
the first alien attack
on American soil.

298
00:14:32.330 --> 00:14:35.124
It's now area zero.
a Checkmate Command Post.

299
00:14:38.252 --> 00:14:40.296
And Eradicator is coming here?

300
00:14:40.838 --> 00:14:43.049
Unless Luthor
is wasting all our time.

301
00:14:43.257 --> 00:14:45.009
The data doesn't lie.

302
00:14:45.093 --> 00:14:46.719
Something is coming.

303
00:14:47.428 --> 00:14:49.972
And we have less than 48 hours
to prepare for it.

304
00:14:53.643 --> 00:14:55.895
[Waller] This operation.
codenamed "Doomsday".

305
00:14:56.270 --> 00:14:57.522
will have two lines of defense.

306
00:14:57.605 --> 00:14:59.023
The first line will be

307
00:14:59.107 --> 00:15:01.442
the superhumans
led by Agent Wilson.

308
00:15:01.609 --> 00:15:03.319
Kryptonians fall in.

309
00:15:03.444 --> 00:15:05.321
Jonathan and Lara will fight.

310
00:15:06.114 --> 00:15:08.616
but they'll take their orders
from Supergirl.

311
00:15:08.825 --> 00:15:10.118
Who decided this?

312
00:15:10.410 --> 00:15:12.412
-[Supergirl] We did.
-Together.

313
00:15:12.620 --> 00:15:14.247
Is there a problem?

314
00:15:15.248 --> 00:15:16.374
Of course not.

315
00:15:16.833 --> 00:15:17.959
Glad to have you.

316
00:15:18.459 --> 00:15:21.170
Let's hope you're as super
as you think you are.

317
00:15:22.964 --> 00:15:26.384
[engines rumbling]

318
00:15:32.223 --> 00:15:34.976
[all grunting]

319
00:15:40.356 --> 00:15:41.691
[hissing]

320
00:15:57.582 --> 00:15:58.583
[grunts]

321
00:16:28.404 --> 00:16:30.990
[scoffs] Are you really
running away again?

322
00:16:31.407 --> 00:16:34.160
I know when to get off
a sinking ship.

323
00:16:34.243 --> 00:16:36.370
What? This is your ship!

324
00:16:36.954 --> 00:16:39.624
You have to face the problems
you created!

325
00:16:39.874 --> 00:16:43.044
Me? The Kryptonians did this.

326
00:16:43.127 --> 00:16:44.295
You made the monster!

327
00:16:44.545 --> 00:16:45.838
You set it free!

328
00:16:46.589 --> 00:16:48.132
What am I supposed to do?

329
00:16:48.299 --> 00:16:50.134
Just let the aliens
rule over us?

330
00:16:51.802 --> 00:16:53.596
I get why you're scared.

331
00:16:54.055 --> 00:16:55.139
I'm human. too.

332
00:16:55.431 --> 00:16:58.559
But those aliens have been
paying for your mistakes. Lex.

333
00:16:59.393 --> 00:17:02.188
It's time to act like
the hero you pretend to be.

334
00:17:02.730 --> 00:17:04.190
Or admit that
you're the villain.

335
00:17:06.943 --> 00:17:09.319
[intense music playing]

336
00:17:09.987 --> 00:17:11.489
[Clark panting]

337
00:17:12.323 --> 00:17:13.699
[grunts]
Huh?

338
00:17:17.787 --> 00:17:19.247
[speaking Coluan] Choprra.

339
00:17:20.748 --> 00:17:22.333
Lot'zar memu shin!

340
00:17:23.209 --> 00:17:24.585
Lot'zar!

341
00:17:24.669 --> 00:17:26.045
I'm not here to fight.

342
00:17:26.503 --> 00:17:27.755
Wah hu shah.

343
00:17:27.838 --> 00:17:30.174
Please. your friend needs help.

344
00:17:30.258 --> 00:17:31.425
[baby crying]

345
00:17:34.387 --> 00:17:36.138
You people aren't invaders.

346
00:17:37.139 --> 00:17:38.849
You're refugees!

347
00:17:39.517 --> 00:17:41.561
Wait! No. Please.

348
00:17:41.644 --> 00:17:42.979
I don't want to hurt you.

349
00:17:44.855 --> 00:17:46.274
Don't!

350
00:17:46.357 --> 00:17:47.733
I have to get home.

351
00:17:48.484 --> 00:17:49.527
[grunts]

352
00:17:50.695 --> 00:17:51.696
[gasps]

353
00:17:51.779 --> 00:17:53.114
Don't make me do this.

354
00:17:54.824 --> 00:17:55.866
[growls]

355
00:17:56.284 --> 00:17:57.868
[Chief Steward] Do it!

356
00:17:58.869 --> 00:18:00.413
No.

357
00:18:00.538 --> 00:18:01.831
They already died once.

358
00:18:01.872 --> 00:18:03.541
What's the harm
in killing them again?

359
00:18:04.041 --> 00:18:05.876
Show us your strength.

360
00:18:07.044 --> 00:18:10.756
[Clark grunting]

361
00:18:12.925 --> 00:18:13.968
Yes!

362
00:18:16.554 --> 00:18:17.555
No!

363
00:18:18.139 --> 00:18:19.390
[muttering in Coluan]

364
00:18:19.682 --> 00:18:22.351
I won't murder these people
just to satisfy you.

365
00:18:23.227 --> 00:18:24.979
That's not what strength is.

366
00:18:25.938 --> 00:18:27.732
Then you will perish here.

367
00:18:29.692 --> 00:18:33.195
And your family's hope
will die with you.

368
00:18:34.739 --> 00:18:35.823
[Alien Leader] Hevar.

369
00:18:39.994 --> 00:18:41.454
[speaking Coluan]
Or'e mak du hevar.

370
00:18:41.996 --> 00:18:43.247
[Chief Steward] No.

371
00:18:44.957 --> 00:18:46.083
Thank you.

372
00:18:47.877 --> 00:18:49.211
[Chief Steward] No!

373
00:18:49.253 --> 00:18:50.588
Enough. Brainiac.

374
00:18:51.088 --> 00:18:52.340
I've won your game.

375
00:18:53.299 --> 00:18:56.177
We offer you power.
and you reject it?

376
00:18:57.928 --> 00:19:01.599
You can perish in your weakness.

377
00:19:05.269 --> 00:19:06.395
[somber music playing]

378
00:19:06.729 --> 00:19:08.147
Where is Luthor?

379
00:19:10.274 --> 00:19:12.526
I'm here. Director Waller.

380
00:19:15.154 --> 00:19:17.156
[sparking]

381
00:19:22.745 --> 00:19:24.288
[bang]

382
00:19:26.040 --> 00:19:28.751
[intense music playing]

383
00:19:31.295 --> 00:19:33.297
[eerie music playing]

384
00:19:36.384 --> 00:19:37.468
[Eradicator chuckles]

385
00:19:37.635 --> 00:19:39.261
You were expecting me.

386
00:19:41.097 --> 00:19:44.517
I am the being
you call Eradicator.

387
00:19:44.600 --> 00:19:46.018
and I am here...

388
00:19:46.227 --> 00:19:47.269
[Jonathan grunts]

389
00:19:52.483 --> 00:19:53.484
[all gasp]

390
00:19:54.151 --> 00:19:55.319
I told you I'd do it.

391
00:19:55.820 --> 00:19:58.322
We don't need anyone
to come save us.

392
00:19:59.156 --> 00:20:00.616
[growls]

393
00:20:00.908 --> 00:20:04.120
Like I said. I am Superman.

394
00:20:04.245 --> 00:20:05.538
I...
[grunts]

395
00:20:05.996 --> 00:20:07.456
[bang]

396
00:20:07.915 --> 00:20:09.208
Jonathan!

397
00:20:09.625 --> 00:20:10.668
Fools.

398
00:20:10.751 --> 00:20:13.879
You have no Superman
to defend you.

399
00:20:14.171 --> 00:20:17.800
And I'm here to make sure
you never do.

400
00:20:20.845 --> 00:20:21.846
[Clark] Your invaders.

401
00:20:21.887 --> 00:20:23.527
they called me something
there at the end.

402
00:20:23.848 --> 00:20:25.015
What was it?

403
00:20:25.266 --> 00:20:26.786
[Chief Steward]
They called you friend.

404
00:20:27.059 --> 00:20:30.521
And that Kal-El
is why you failed.

405
00:20:30.646 --> 00:20:32.857
I defeated their leader.
I won them over...

406
00:20:33.023 --> 00:20:36.694
I sent you to dominate the
Coluans. not befriend them.

407
00:20:37.319 --> 00:20:39.447
It is their fate to serve you.

408
00:20:39.822 --> 00:20:42.324
As it is always the fate of
the weak to serve the strong.

409
00:20:42.533 --> 00:20:44.326
The entire trajectory
of the Empire

410
00:20:44.368 --> 00:20:47.913
is built on
that one just principle.

411
00:20:48.956 --> 00:20:50.666
And where did that
trajectory end?

412
00:20:52.001 --> 00:20:53.335
Where's your Empire now?

413
00:20:54.378 --> 00:20:57.506
We will not be questioned
by a beggar.

414
00:20:58.048 --> 00:20:59.008
[struggling]

415
00:20:59.049 --> 00:21:00.551
If the weak do not
serve the strong.

416
00:21:00.634 --> 00:21:03.053
then what is the order
of the universe?

417
00:21:03.304 --> 00:21:06.056
What is the purpose
of our sacrifice?

418
00:21:06.515 --> 00:21:09.894
How have we spent
these last 10.0000 years?

419
00:21:10.478 --> 00:21:11.896
You...

420
00:21:12.146 --> 00:21:14.857
You're the one
I carried up the mountain.

421
00:21:15.399 --> 00:21:16.734
Yes.

422
00:21:18.319 --> 00:21:22.281
We are the eternal servant
of the Empire.

423
00:21:22.782 --> 00:21:24.909
But what they did to you...

424
00:21:26.035 --> 00:21:27.411
I'm so sorry.

425
00:21:28.078 --> 00:21:29.914
Enough!

426
00:21:30.247 --> 00:21:32.625
You insult
our millennia of service

427
00:21:32.750 --> 00:21:36.754
with your pretense of mercy.
and you will die for it.

428
00:21:37.671 --> 00:21:39.423
[Clark] I have to get back
to my family.

429
00:21:39.590 --> 00:21:42.051
-We tried to teach you. Kal-El.
-[grunting]

430
00:21:42.760 --> 00:21:44.762
There can be no compromise.

431
00:21:45.554 --> 00:21:49.099
Only weakness and strength.

432
00:21:51.268 --> 00:21:52.436
[Bizarro] Die!

433
00:21:54.772 --> 00:21:59.109
[screaming]

434
00:22:03.781 --> 00:22:06.617
[closing theme music playing]

434
00:22:07.305 --> 00:23:07.858
